ount of water.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=76179&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:86428:1","headword":"해감","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"바닷물 등에서 흙과 작고 더러운 물질이 썩어 생기는 냄새나는 찌꺼기.","englishExpression":"dreg; sediment; mud","englishDescription":"Stinky residue that forms by the decaying of soil and small, dirty substances in seawater, etc.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=86428&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"sector":[{"id":"krdict:60043:2","headword":"부채꼴","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"각도를 이루는 두 개의 반지름과 하나의 둥근 둘레로 둘러싸인 면.","englishExpression":"sector","englishDescription":"The plane encircled by one arc and two radii creating an angle.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60043&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"sham":[{"id":"krdict:15197:1","headword":"엉터리","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"엉뚱한 말이나 행동. 또는 그런 말이나 행동을 하는 사람.","englishExpression":"nonsense; absurdity; sham","englishDescription":"A nonsensical utterance or act, or a person who talks or acts in such a manner.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15197&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"shanty":[{"id":"krdict:80823:1","headword":"판잣집","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"널빤지로 사방을 둘러서 허술하게 지은 집.","englishExpression":"board-framed house; shack; shanty","englishDescription":"A badly-built house made of planks.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=80823&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}],"toner":[{"id":"krdict:601493:1","headword":"토너","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"복사기나 프린터에서 잉크 대신 사용하는 검은색 가루.","englishExpression":"toner","englishDescription":"Black powder used instead of ink in copiers and printers.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60