eechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"한 해.","englishExpression":"year","englishDescription":"A year.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67624&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:72468:2","headword":"해","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"명사","definitionKo":"지구가 태양을 한 바퀴 도는 동안. 한 해는 열두 달이다.","englishExpression":"year","englishDescription":"The time during which the earth rotates around the sun once.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72468&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:91766:1","headword":"주년","partOfSpeech":"noun","partOfSpeechKo":"의존 명사","definitionKo":"일 년을 단위로 돌아오는 해를 세는 단위.","englishExpression":"year","englishDescription":"A bound noun that serves as a unit for counting a recurring period that spans a year.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=91766&nation=eng&nationCode=6"}]}}
